# Frontend (Vite) — copy to .env and adjust.
# Leave EMPTY to use the same-origin dev proxy (recommended locally: the
# session cookie stays first-party, so refresh keeps you logged in).
# Set an absolute URL only for split production hosting (Vercel page →
# separate API host), e.g. VITE_API_URL=https://api.example.com
# (baked at build time — redeploy to change).
VITE_API_URL=
